From a4a4aee5fd9d3df961d9e81cfe32e08d7857bc00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ghajarvpn Build <build@ghajarvpn.local>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:18:31 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(welcome): one random full-bleed poster with a rotating
 navy tip card

Drop the carousel, pager dots and the enter button. Every launch shows
exactly one random poster (never the previous one) inside the always
present navy brand card that rotates a short Persian feature tip.
Tapping anywhere enters the app and the returning-user auto-close is
preserved; the poster renders synchronously so no blank frame appears.
